                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If you are looking for a game that spoofs bluescreens to emphasize mission dialogue and then has the NPC gloat over your frustration, look no further. This is the game for you. \nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3823203576\nIf you are in the camp of people that rather expect a developer respect your sanity after taking your money, STAY CLEAR!\nCan agree with most of the criticism. The repetition, low production value, cringy dialogue and a Bug Report button hardcoded into the Ships Hotbar[!] , could all be forgiven, the pathetic bluescreen spoof however warrants to NEVER PURCHASE any of these failed clowns hot garbage releases PERIOD! \n\nI rarely go all out on small studios, but this one has completely ruined any goodwill I had for their games.",
